nopush/

# Sun and shadow, close-zoom pages (6 ft cells, about 162 MB). The app uses them when they are there and works
# without them. Delete the next line to publish them with the site.
app/public/data/shadow/fine/

# Lot files (app/public/data/parcel-shadow/, about 58 MB, scripts/15; app/public/data/parcel-lots/, about 4 MB,
# scripts/22) are published with the site since 2026-10-27, for the Place page's Parcel level and Explore's By parcel
# view (Ye: real lots, lot facts only, never owners or values).
